# 🎯 My Job Hunt

### Paste a job link. Get a tailored, ATS-ready CV, or an honest "not qualified".

![Skills](https://img.shields.io/badge/skills-14-1F3A5F?style=for-the-badge)
![ATS pass mark](https://img.shields.io/badge/ATS%20pass%20mark-85%2B-2E7D32?style=for-the-badge)
![Honesty](https://img.shields.io/badge/never%20invents%20facts-100%25-B71C1C?style=for-the-badge)

</div>

---

## ✨ What it does

An AI job-application system for your agent. It reads a job posting, **checks honestly whether you qualify**, and if you do, writes a **tailored CV and cover letter** that pass applicant tracking systems.

> 🔒 **It never invents anything.** Every fact comes from one file: your **master profile** at
> `.claude/skills/master-profile/SKILL.md`. Every CV, cover letter and verdict is built from it.

```
  🔗 Job link ──► 📄 Parse ──► ⚖️ Eligibility ──┬──► ✅ Qualified ──► 🧩 Tailor ──► ✍️ Write
                                               │                                     │
                                               │                                     ▼
                                               │                              🤖 ATS audit (85+)
                                               │                                     │
                                               └──► ❌ Not qualified                 ▼
                                                    (honest reasons,          🎨 Format ──► 📦 CV + Letter
                                                     no documents)               DOCX + PDF
```

---

## 🚀 Quick start

### Step 1: Set up your profile (once)

Paste this as your first message to the agent:

> **Update my profile.** Read `inputs/old-cv.pdf` and use `master-profile-builder` to fill the master-profile skill with everything in it, then ask me about every TODO that's left.

**What happens**

- 📥 It imports your old CV automatically.
- 💬 It interviews you in short rounds (max 5 questions at a time) to fill the gaps.
- ✅ You answer honestly: work authorization, exact job titles and dates, **employment type per role** (full-time / internship / freelance / end-of-study), and real numbers (users, endpoints, hours saved).

> ⚠️ **Why this matters:** every future CV is only as good as this profile. Wrong or missing facts show up in every document. If you don't know a number, say **"no metric available"** and never let it guess.

### Step 2: Apply to a job (one line per job)

```text
Full pack for https://link-to-the-job
```

It fetches the posting, assesses eligibility and, if you qualify, builds the CV, cover letter, DOCX and PDF. Everything is saved in `jobs/<company-role-date>/`.

---

## 🗣️ Commands you can say

| Say this | What it does |
|---|---|
| `Full pack for <link>` | The whole pipeline: assess, tailor, CV, cover letter, DOCX + PDF |
| `Assess only <link>` | 🔎 Tells you if you're qualified. No documents. |
| `CV for <link>` | 📄 Builds the CV, skips the cover letter |
| `Override, apply anyway <link>` | 🚧 Forces an application despite "Not qualified". Output is labelled STRETCH / UNQUALIFIED so it stays honest |
| `Optimize my LinkedIn` | 💼 Runs the LinkedIn profile optimizer |
| `Update my profile` | 🔄 Re-runs the profile builder when you gain new skills, jobs or projects |

---

## ⚖️ What the verdicts mean

The eligibility assessor scores you out of 100 **before** writing anything.

| Verdict | Score | What happens |
|---|:---:|---|
| 🟢 **STRONG FIT** | 80 to 100 | Continues automatically |
| 🔵 **QUALIFIED** | 65 to 79 | Continues automatically, addresses gaps in the cover letter |
| 🟡 **STRETCH** | 50 to 64 | Warns about low odds and what's missing. Continues only if you say *"apply anyway"* or *"override"* |
| 🔴 **NOT QUALIFIED** | below 50, or a knockout requirement fails | Stops. Explains the 1 to 3 blockers, how to become qualified, and suggests better-fit searches |

> A knockout requirement (a required country, language, degree, mandatory certification, or far more years than you have) means **NOT QUALIFIED** whatever the score.

💡 **Honesty beats score.** If a job needs Go and PostgreSQL and your profile has neither, it says so and writes nothing unless you override.

When it stops, it offers: *"Say 'override' if you want me to write the most honest version anyway."*

---

## 📁 What lands in each job folder

After a **Full pack**, `jobs/<company-role-date>/` contains:

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `job.md` | The parsed posting and its requirements |
| `eligibility.md` | Verdict, score and gaps |
| `tailoring-plan.md` | What to emphasize for this job |
| `cv.md` | The CV source text |
| `…_CV.pdf` / `…_CV.docx` | ⭐ The CV to submit |
| `…_CoverLetter.pdf` / `…_CoverLetter.docx` | The cover letter |
| `ats-report.md` | ATS audit (must reach **85+** to pass) |

📎 **Which file to upload:** the **PDF**, unless the portal asks for Word / DOCX.

