## 🧰 The 14 skills

| Skill | Role |
|---|---|
| 🎼 `job-application-orchestrator` | Runs the whole pipeline from a job link |
| 🌐 `web-to-markdown` | Turns a job link into a clean, structured `job.md` |
| 🧑 `master-profile` | Your verified facts: the only source of truth |
| 🛠️ `master-profile-builder` | Imports your CV and interviews you to fill gaps |
| ⚖️ `job-eligibility-assessor` | Honest go / no-go with score and gaps |
| 🧩 `resume-tailor` | Picks what to emphasize for this job, plus a keyword map |
| 🧱 `resume-section-builder` | Writes each CV section to a fixed standard |
| 🔢 `resume-quantifier` | Adds real numbers, never fake ones |
| ✍️ `resume-build-writer` | Assembles the full CV text |
| 🤖 `resume-ats-optimizer` | ATS parsing and keyword audit |
| 🎨 `cv-design` | Layout and typography rules that stay ATS-safe |
| 📐 `resume-formatter` | Produces the DOCX and PDF |
| 💌 `cover-letter-generator` | Tailored letter and application answers |
| 💼 `linkedin-profile-optimizer` | Rewrites your LinkedIn for recruiter search |

---

## 🌐 If the agent can't open a job link

LinkedIn and some job boards block automated fetching. The agent will then ask you to **paste the job description text**. Paste it and the same pipeline continues, skipping only the fetch step.

---

## 🛡️ Rules the system follows

1. **Never fabricate** experience, skills, dates, degrees, metrics or links.
2. **Honesty beats optimization.** A lower ATS score with true content is the correct result.
3. **No silent overrides.** A "Not qualified" verdict is never ignored without your say-so.
4. **One job at a time**, each in its own folder under `jobs/`.
5. **Privacy.** It never stores IDs, passwords, exact home address or date of birth.

---

## 💡 Tips

- 🔄 **Keep the master profile current.** After you finish a project, say *"Update my profile"* and give it the new facts and numbers.
- 🔢 **Numbers make a big difference.** Even proxies help: number of endpoints, screens, collections, skills, users, events.
- 🎯 **Spend your effort wisely.** Treat STRETCH jobs as long shots and focus on QUALIFIED and STRONG FIT ones.

